Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:07.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Assalam o Alaikum! Aaj NestPOS mein Product, Kitchen Item aur Recipe ka connection dekhein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:14.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Product customer ko becha jata hai. Kitchen Item kaccha saman hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:21.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Recipe batati hai ke ek Product banane mein kitna saman lagta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:28.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Menu se Ingredients kholen. Yahan kitchen ka kaccha saman darj hota hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:34.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Misal: chawal, chicken, oil aur sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:40.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Har item ka unit, rate, maujooda stock aur kam se kam limit dikhti hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:46.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stock limit se neeche jaye, to system khabardar karta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:55.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naya Kitchen Item add karne ke liye Add Ingredient dabayein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:01:02.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naam Tamatar, unit kg, rate nabbe rupay aur stock bees kg rakhein.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:09.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Kam se kam limit paanch rakhein. Save se item record mein shamil ho jata hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:16.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ab Product ko Kitchen Items ke saath jorne ke liye Recipes kholen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:22.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beef Pulao ki recipe dekhein. Ek plate ke liye pao kilo chawal darj hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:28.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pachaas gram oil bhi darj hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:34.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ek Product mein kai Kitchen Items use ho sakte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:42.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ab sale ka asar dekhein. Sale screen se ek Beef Pulao chunen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:49.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,CASH payment karein. Cart mein add karne par stock foran kam nahi hota.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:55.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bill final hone ke baad recipe ke mutabiq Kitchen Stock khud minus hota hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.39,0:02:04.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yaad rakhein: Product customer ko becha jata hai. Kitchen Item banane mein kharch hota hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:11.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Recipe dono ko milati hai. Har final sale par stock ka hisaab khud chalta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:18.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Is tarah manual ginti nahi karni padti. Shukriya!